Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:10.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快踩油门！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.39,0:00:15.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快报警 我要求……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.64,0:00:20.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 犯人劫持了巴士
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:23.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他要求把你带过去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.67,0:00:27.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.51,0:00:30.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我必须去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.81,0:00:41.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是现场记者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.15,0:00:46.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,目前在葛南隧道内被劫持的巴士正与警方……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.79,0:00:54.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 一有危险就立刻逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.03,0:00:57.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.38,0:01:03.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,劫持巴士的犯人 似乎和我过去的某件事有关
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.63,0:01:06.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,到底是什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.25,0:01:08.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么想也想不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.57,0:01:11.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且只要一去想……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.87,0:01:20.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,来电 未显示号码
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.84,0:01:22.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.75,0:01:27.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能不能稍后再打过来？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.99,0:01:32.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想告诉你一件有趣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.62,0:01:37.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.87,0:01:40.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,此前犯下多起袭击案的池内和哉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:44.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,目前正劫持多名人质
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.58,0:01:51.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,池内要求警方把一个叫田中爱之助的男孩带过去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.47,0:01:55.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们只能等了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.17,0:02:04.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.54,0:02:07.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.72,0:02:10.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你马上就要出狱了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.42,0:02:11.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:15.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.99,0:02:18.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来你在里面表现很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.29,0:02:20.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个嘛……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.57,0:02:24.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你应该想尽快找到你弟弟吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.89,0:02:27.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你知道他的下落？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.73,0:02:33.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果做DNA鉴定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.57,0:02:38.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你就会发现这把雕刻刀上的血迹是你弟弟的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.45,0:02:41.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他很可能就是被这把雕刻刀杀死的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.89,0:02:43.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,被杀？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.44,0:02:45.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,想知道更多的话——
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.81,0:02:50.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,去问这个男孩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.28,0:02:52.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,1年3班 田中爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.52,0:03:07.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这就是田中爱之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.43,0:03:11.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,刚刚有一名学生抵达了现场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:12.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,重复一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.37,0:03:17.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,刚刚有一名学生抵达了现场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.71,0:03:19.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢你赶过来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.18,0:03:21.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们会全力支援你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.65,0:03:25.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以拜托你去见犯人 
打探出他的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.49,0:03:29.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:33.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.03,0:03:46.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 小心点！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:03:58.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,开门！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.13,0:04:05.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们退后！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.12,0:04:24.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,闭嘴！不准哭！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.91,0:04:33.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绑匪的要求已经满足
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.91,0:04:42.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,名叫田中爱之助的学生正准备去见犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.03,0:04:37.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.07,0:04:44.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你就是田中爱之助吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.51,0:04:48.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你把我弟弟怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:50.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.23,0:04:52.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别装傻！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.44,0:04:55.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我弟弟当时负责看着你们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.03,0:04:58.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,从那之后他就一直失踪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.41,0:05:01.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他在哪？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:11.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我弟弟……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.15,0:05:14.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是你用雕刻刀杀了他吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.96,0:05:42.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:54.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,回答我！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.32,0:05:56.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我弟弟到底怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.58,0:06:05.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.97,0:06:10.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这么重要的事……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.68,0:06:21.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:25.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我怎么会全忘了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.60,0:06:26.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,回答我！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.96,0:06:29.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我弟弟到底在哪？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.72,0:06:39.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,被埋在临海地区 Sea Square大楼所在的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.71,0:06:49.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你弟弟……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.82,0:06:54.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,被埋在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:14.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,动手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.43,0:07:15.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就是现在！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.22,0:07:48.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,池内和哉被逮捕了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.79,0:07:54.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,劫持巴士的犯人被捕了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:53.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来你终于想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.01,0:08:00.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只有你一个人把它忘得一干二净 太不公平了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.66,0:08:09.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.13,0:08:14.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.24,0:08:19.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.10,0:08:25.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,都怪我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.73,0:08:29.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥变成那样……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.30,0:08:34.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,都是我的错……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.42,0:08:37.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,闭嘴！不准哭！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.73,0:08:39.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小学一年级的时候……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:41.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好好看着他们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.01,0:08:43.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,……因为我自己不小心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.65,0:08:48.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,被两兄弟绑架了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:52.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥来救我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.61,0:08:57.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,结果他也落入了犯人手中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:00.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.63,0:09:02.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.47,0:09:11.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来你们父母死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.63,0:09:17.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他们急着筹赎金 结果被电车撞死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:23.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真是两个蠢货！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.93,0:09:28.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,孩子没救成 自己倒先死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.15,0:09:33.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.08,0:09:36.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我说过你要是再敢出声 我就宰了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.48,0:10:02.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.19,0:10:05.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:07.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.85,0:10:09.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那一次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:15.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥为了保护我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.34,0:10:20.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,第一次杀了人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.32,0:10:28.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是我把自己的亲哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.03,0:10:35.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,变成了杀人凶手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:38.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:05.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 把今天发生的事都忘了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:09.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,全都忘掉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.99,0:11:17.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:36.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,田中爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.84,0:11:39.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,多亏了你 我们才抓到了犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.79,0:11:44.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但关于你提到的杀人案 我们必须向你问话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.31,0:11:46.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,跟我们走一趟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.70,0:11:49.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.01,0:11:51.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不好意思 他今天太累了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.87,0:11:53.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请让他休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.94,0:11:54.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,带走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.69,0:11:55.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:58.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哪怕就一天也好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.23,0:11:59.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.53,0:12:01.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.48,0:12:22.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,宫元先生 为什么要带我来这种地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.13,0:12:25.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我没打算对你做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.40,0:12:29.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只是不想让你再去妨碍梦人先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.39,0:12:32.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,梦人先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.05,0:12:38.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他除掉了福地警视 我才能坐上这个位子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:42.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以我非常感激梦人先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.44,0:12:45.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.10,0:12:48.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你是我哥哥的同伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.17,0:12:50.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.14,0:12:57.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来你终于想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:13:03.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这段时间以来 只有我一个人背负着杀人的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.25,0:13:09.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,每次看到
什么都不记得的你开心地笑着……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.61,0:13:15.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我都觉得自己快要发疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.41,0:13:18.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你能体会吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.02,0:13:25.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,每天晚上 那个被杀的家伙都会出现在我梦里对我说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:31.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“杀人凶手 你休想开心过日子 ”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.36,0:13:34.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,每一天都是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:36.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你不觉得这很不公平吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.69,0:13:44.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,既然如此……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:48.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么你的目标不是我？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.69,0:13:53.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,都是因为我 哥哥才会杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.74,0:13:58.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以就算你杀了我 我也毫无怨言
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.22,0:14:04.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.51,0:14:12.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树和他妈妈是无辜的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.59,0:14:16.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,平先生的儿子也与这无关
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.05,0:14:21.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有在BLUE HEAVEN演唱会上受重伤的岛田
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.58,0:14:24.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有谷田部先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.13,0:14:31.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,みるく小姐也是无辜的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.16,0:14:42.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把无辜的人玩弄于股掌之中 绝对不可原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.71,0:14:50.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哪怕赌上我的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.63,0:14:56.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我……一定会阻止你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.24,0:15:06.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,挺能说的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.44,0:15:09.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.94,0:15:14.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,多亏了你 我的计划进入了最终阶段
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.57,0:15:18.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你想起了埋尸的地点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.86,0:15:22.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也给了我挖掘那栋大楼的正当理由
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.24,0:15:28.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 哥哥 站住！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:29.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.91,0:16:09.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,房东先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.63,0:16:11.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,炸弹？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.44,0:16:14.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.54,0:16:19.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,池内和哉案的调查进展如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:20.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.97,0:16:25.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,由于田中爱之助指认的地点已经建起了大楼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.86,0:16:30.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,特别小组应我们的要求制定了方案
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.48,0:16:35.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们会在Sea Square大楼旁挖一个30米深的坑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.76,0:16:41.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,随后横向挖掘至大楼正下方进行搜查
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.79,0:16:46.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我需要看清地下的情况 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.08,0:16:47.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:07.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.65,0:17:10.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不愧是专业人士
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.17,0:17:31.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不愧是房东先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.57,0:17:49.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一切就绪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.03,0:17:52.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.57,0:18:22.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,神山首相 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.19,0:18:29.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在东京……不 全日本都在我手上当人质
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.88,0:18:33.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.14,0:18:36.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我打算摧毁东京的一栋大楼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.84,0:18:42.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,里面放着维持东京运转的超级计算机
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.72,0:18:47.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一旦摧毁那栋大楼 整个东京的系统和网络都将陷入瘫痪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.85,0:18:49.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你明白这意味着什么吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.34,0:18:51.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,神山首相
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.18,0:18:52.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,首相
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.44,0:18:59.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,听到了吗？神山首相
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:03.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你到底想要什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.02,0:19:07.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请把钱汇入我们的账户
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.24,0:19:10.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,金额是50万亿日元
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.49,0:19:13.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,50万亿？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.15,0:19:16.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那栋大楼戒备森严
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.31,0:19:18.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绝不可能被摧毁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.69,0:19:22.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那就让我来证明我没有说谎吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.55,0:19:38.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,首相！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.44,0:19:40.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,区政府大楼刚刚被炸毁了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.26,0:19:41.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么……？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.39,0:19:49.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来现在还是行不通啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.03,0:19:51.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我给你们考虑的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.90,0:19:54.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,限时5个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.60,0:19:56.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,静候佳音
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.48,0:20:05.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是Sea Square大楼的画面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.67,0:20:08.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,多亏了你 我的计划进入了最终阶段
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.24,0:20:12.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这应该就是关键线索
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.66,0:20:24.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.19,0:20:25.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.36,0:20:26.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.20,0:20:27.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有加藤先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.47,0:20:28.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您怎么会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:31.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有人给我出主意说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.45,0:20:36.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“只要拜托加藤刑警装上窃听器
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.85,0:20:39.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就能听到很多有趣的事情 ”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.29,0:20:42.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢老师 还有加藤先生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.34,0:20:48.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一开始还不信 但在狭山老师的软磨硬泡下照做了 结果听到之后简直惊呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.06,0:20:49.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这么说 你们听到昨天说的话了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.90,0:20:51.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一字不漏
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:56.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个混蛋……看我不好好收拾他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.57,0:21:17.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 我有样东西要给你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.21,0:21:21.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是福地警视的记事本
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.24,0:21:29.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,说不定你能从中找到什么线索
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.25,0:21:31.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,很遗憾我没能看出来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.36,0:21:35.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但交给你或许能发现什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.32,0:21:46.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们兵分两路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.23,0:21:49.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我来争取时间 你们快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.82,0:21:50.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那加藤先生你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.72,0:21:51.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事的 快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.83,0:21:53.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,三 二 一 走！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.93,0:21:56.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 这边 这边！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.06,0:21:57.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.19,0:22:13.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.44,0:22:17.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你这个……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.27,0:22:29.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我全都录下来了！宫元警视 你跟爱之助说的话 我全录下来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.02,0:22:40.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽说我只是个普通刑警 
但我向来坚持伸张正义
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.84,0:22:45.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绝不原谅你这种沦为罪犯走狗的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.16,0:23:05.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,多米诺骨牌效应……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.46,0:23:14.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,多米诺骨牌效应是指所有案件都环环相扣 还是说……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.83,0:23:23.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道是……？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.03,0:23:25.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.11,0:23:28.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们要去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.75,0:23:32.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我得先去一个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.26,0:23:45.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你好啊 爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.98,0:23:50.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.33,0:23:57.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,房东先生 之前的爆炸案都是你干的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.32,0:24:01.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还是被你发现了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.43,0:24:05.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我本来不想让你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:12.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真遗憾 我本来还想继续和你做朋友的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.93,0:24:16.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在你又在策划下一场爆炸吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.00,0:24:19.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,连这个你都知道了？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.17,0:24:22.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.77,0:24:27.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,炸弹到底装在哪里？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.50,0:24:31.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我可是专业的 不能泄密
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.12,0:24:38.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过看在是你的份上 就告诉你一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.66,0:24:55.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那就是……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.96,0:25:26.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,背叛者死
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.89,0:25:31.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 怎么这么慢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.63,0:25:32.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 你得快点逃
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.58,0:25:34.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了 出什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.09,0:25:36.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,房东先生被杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.11,0:25:37.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.56,0:25:41.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！我不想再逃避了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.25,0:25:47.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我决定了 绝不让你一个人去承担
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.36,0:25:54.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,明白了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.30,0:26:00.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对了 有件事想拜托你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.66,0:26:05.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.45,0:26:07.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.67,0:26:13.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我……要去见我哥
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.47,0:26:24.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太矮了 不是从这里看的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.49,0:26:30.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥在能看到那种景色的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.80,0:27:06.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,吉田人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.05,0:27:12.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,背叛者死 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.35,0:27:20.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真遗憾……他看不到这场好戏了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.75,0:27:32.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,神山首相
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.69,0:27:36.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,时间到了 你的答复是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.06,0:27:39.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们无法轻易答复
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.33,0:27:41.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还需要时间开会商议
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.96,0:27:43.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.52,0:27:46.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那真是太遗憾了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.85,0:27:50.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,游戏结束 永别了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.09,0:27:51.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等 先别挂……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.43,0:27:54.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们现在正在召开内阁会议……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.14,0:27:57.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么 这就挂了？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.40,0:28:01.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你还真够无情的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.34,0:28:04.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,本来还能再谈谈条件呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.65,0:28:08.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你很缺钱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.71,0:28:13.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,欣赏好戏可不需要钱
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.88,0:28:31.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小老鼠也跟来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.99,0:28:42.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.68,0:28:49.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,收手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.02,0:28:51.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太迟了 爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.34,0:28:59.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,既然你找来了这里 就代表你识破了我的计划吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.72,0:29:05.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,掌管东京系统运作的超级电脑所在的那栋大楼
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.67,0:29:10.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,安保极其严密 根本无从下手
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.21,0:29:12.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,多米诺骨牌效应
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.06,0:29:22.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你没法在那栋大楼直接安放炸弹 所以
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.49,0:29:27.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,打算借由破坏其他大楼来炸毁它
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.81,0:29:30.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真能干 全让你猜中了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.84,0:29:32.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你还笑得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.34,0:29:36.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们兄弟俩的闹剧到此为止了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.29,0:29:46.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你对你弟弟太心软了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.58,0:29:50.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.29,0:30:03.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,典子小姐 就算你的枪法再好 
空包弹也是杀不了我的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.76,0:30:14.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,忘了我做事向来周全吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.43,0:30:25.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“背叛者死” 你是这么说的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.94,0:30:30.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.89,0:30:51.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真不愧是田中梦人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.57,0:30:55.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过你高兴得太早了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.12,0:31:00.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在把枪交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.74,0:31:03.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.25,0:31:11.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来你真的背叛了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.14,0:31:25.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你终究还是没能对弟弟下手
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.40,0:31:29.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,舍弃不掉那点廉价的温情
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.11,0:31:34.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以我决定离开你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.66,0:31:42.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能活到最后的人才是赢家
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.61,0:31:47.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这次是我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.12,0:31:53.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你确定吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.88,0:32:00.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我说过我做事向来周全吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.94,0:32:05.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我装了自毁装置
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.91,0:32:08.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,自毁装置？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.49,0:32:13.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要你们开枪打死我 整栋大楼就会被炸上天
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.04,0:32:15.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能活到最后的人才是赢家
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.50,0:32:18.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那么这场胜负就没有赢家了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.03,0:32:24.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,杀了我 大家一起死
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.73,0:32:31.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.66,0:32:35.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要一起死在这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.51,0:32:44.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你以为我和你共事多少年了？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.42,0:32:49.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你这种人绝不会选择自寻死路
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.19,0:32:51.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这不过是虚张声势！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.45,0:32:59.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这次要彻底了结你
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.91,0:33:02.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.97,0:33:25.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.14,0:33:30.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那么 爱之助……
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.36,0:33:38.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,最后的狂欢要开演了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.76,0:33:41.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.28,0:34:34.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么样 弟弟？很有趣吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.32,0:34:49.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 到底发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.66,0:34:51.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那些大楼会像多米诺骨牌一样接连倒塌
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.53,0:34:55.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果最后一栋大楼爆炸 东京就彻底完了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.25,0:34:58.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.76,0:34:59.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 那个呢……？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.90,0:35:01.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我带来了 但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.45,0:36:02.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,前一栋大楼会倒向那边 所以炸弹一定装在这附近
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.48,0:36:14.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 消防栓！
- 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.05,0:36:15.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快找消防栓！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.54,0:36:17.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,消防栓……消防栓……
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.02,0:36:32.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.93,0:36:34.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.64,0:36:36.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.55,0:36:39.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.16,0:36:54.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要灌入液氮应该就能停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.82,0:37:02.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了 停下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.90,0:37:06.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.60,0:37:27.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,停下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.65,0:37:37.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.00,0:37:52.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.61,0:37:57.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,停下了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.99,0:38:03.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没错！我们阻止它了！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.55,0:38:05.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.76,0:38:09.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.93,0:38:20.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,居然真的停下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.40,0:38:27.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.14,0:38:33.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我必须过去一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.53,0:38:35.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.18,0:38:43.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我哥哥……我必须去救我哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.41,0:38:50.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.02,0:38:54.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但你要答应我
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.75,0:38:57.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,答应我一定要平安回来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.28,0:39:24.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.10,0:39:37.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 你怎么会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.41,0:39:43.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这还用问吗？我是来送你去医院的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.93,0:39:48.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我要你活下去 为自己的罪孽赎罪
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.84,0:39:52.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.63,0:40:22.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 居然能阻止这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.95,0:40:26.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,都是多亏了这只左眼
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.34,0:40:28.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,眼睛？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.14,0:40:37.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,移植给我的这只你的眼睛 
一直在给我提示
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.71,0:40:45.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有它 我就无法阻止你了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.68,0:40:56.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我觉得 在你内心深处 
其实也是渴望被阻止的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.53,0:41:05.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正因如此 我的左眼才会看到你所看到的画面
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.18,0:41:14.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你真是个笨蛋……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.15,0:41:17.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你到底为什么要……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.90,0:41:23.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,因为哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.23,0:41:28.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是我唯一的家人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.77,0:41:44.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不要 怎么会这样……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.78,0:41:49.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.26,0:41:58.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.90,0:42:05.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.32,0:42:11.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.34,0:42:34.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,此时此刻听到我声音的各位……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.75,0:42:38.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们有家人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.86,0:42:43.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我曾经也有过无比优秀的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.87,0:42:50.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一位温柔 聪明又帅气的哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.24,0:42:56.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,希望无论他身在何处 都能在天上注视着我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.98,0:43:01.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.33,0:43:04.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,该走啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.65,0:43:11.42,SongTop,,0,0,0,,即使眼中映出的世界满是悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.35,0:43:08.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.64,0:43:18.01,SongTop,,0,0,0,,我们的青春物语也绝不再逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.23,0:43:17.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,海风的气味……真是个舒服的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.10,0:43:26.00,SongTop,,0,0,0,,凝视前方 一定能寻找到光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.33,0:43:21.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,みるく小姐能康复真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.97,0:43:27.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,跑起来吧 凛？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.10,0:43:33.93,SongTop,,0,0,0,,因为想看到泪水过后的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.03,0:43:40.73,SongTop,,0,0,0,,就算对未来感到不安 也不要敷衍逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.98,0:43:47.26,SongTop,,0,0,0,,不要对自己说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.89,0:43:46.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且精神百倍！宫元的处分已经定下来了 我总算安心了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.14,0:43:49.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.29,0:43:54.72,SongTop,,0,0,0,,纵然迷茫 迷茫 再迷茫 依然怀揣梦想 追逐梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.31,0:43:54.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其实又接到了一个新案子
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.53,0:44:00.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,私下跟你说 好像是一起密室杀人案……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.23,0:44:04.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有传闻说 可能跟你哥哥有关
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.59,0:44:09.85,SongTop,,0,0,0,,凝视前方 我们一定能寻找到光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.50,0:44:11.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.67,0:44:18.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果又是哥哥策划的 我想我必须去解开它
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.02,0:44:25.12,SongTop,,0,0,0,,直到照亮 泪痕留下的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.49,0:44:21.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真的吗 那太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.41,0:44:32.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生 我等下回给你
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.85,0:44:35.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 来了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.17,0:44:36.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,来了……你的眼睛又？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.78,0:44:38.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.19,0:44:39.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这里可是墓地啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.36,0:44:41.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.21,0:44:45.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.59,0:44:49.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么躲开了？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.26,0:44:50.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,开个玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.42,0:44:52.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起对不起 来吧 用全力打
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.08,0:44:54.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,耍我玩呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.03,0:45:10.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,将抽选赠送20名观众 去年播出的特别篇DVD
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.86,0:45:15.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请写明住址 姓名 年龄 以及对节目的感想
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.87,0:45:21.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,本剧的系列DVD-BOX将于5月发售 详情敬请期待
